<section class="noula-section">
  <div class="noula-section__inner">
    <p class="noula-section__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h2 class="noula-section__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>

    <div class="noula-faq-list">
      <details open>
        <summary>Who is Noula for?</summary>
        <p>Noula is for dry, dull, tired-looking skin, especially when your face looks less rested than you feel.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I use it?</summary>
        <p>Apply at night as the last step in your routine. Use the spatula to scoop a small amount, then smooth over clean skin.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What makes it different from a regular night cream?</summary>
        <p>Noula is built for tired-looking morning skin, not broad anti-aging or generic moisture.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is it heavy or greasy?</summary>
        <p>It is designed to feel rich and comforting without leaving a greasy pillow feel.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if it does not work for me?</summary>
        <p>Noula includes a 30-day money-back guarantee, so customers can try it with less risk.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Noula FAQ",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "Questions before you try it"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "What to know before your first night"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Noula FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
